WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.869
Not every dream in the Archive is a happy one.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.339
Theo had a dream he never told anyone about.

00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:06.029
A nightmare has broken free. And it belongs to your friend.

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:54.046
Mira? Is this real? It's the crows again. Since I was little, always the crows.

00:01:55.260 --> 00:02:01.046
It's your nightmare. It escaped. But it can only be as big as you let it.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:05.418
Mira knew that look. She had been afraid too.

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:37.038
I'm not brave like you. I joke around so nobody sees I'm scared.

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:44.506
Theo, you walked into a magic archive with cookies. You're the bravest person I know.

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:10.054
Okay. Okay. Crows. Listen up.

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:14.026
Fear gets smaller when someone holds your hand.

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:27.037
You're just birds. Loud, annoying birds. And I'm not little anymore!

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:02.057
I did that. I actually did that!

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:07.026
See? Scary dreams just want someone to look at them.

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:35.019
You returned a nightmare without fighting it. The Archive has not seen that in a hundred years.

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:40.227
For the first time in years, Theo slept without crows.

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:49.869
But hurry. Tomorrow is the last night. The seventh.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:55.227
One night left. And the dream still needed to come home.

